<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108554" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκῑνέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>move softly</i> or <i>lightly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεφύρου ὑποκινήσαντος</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κῦμα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.423
			</span></i> (better <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπο κ.,</span>
			v. Sch. A), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.596c
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, of the apparent <i>vibration</i> of the moon, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				101
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>urge gently on,</i> so as to make him speak, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Chrm.</u>
				162d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Aem.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἔγκλημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Eun.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κινέω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					11.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>move a little,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδεμία πόλις ἂν ὑπεκίνησε</span>
			not a single city <i>would have stirred a finger,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.106
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				644
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				3.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἐφέδρου ὅτι μὴ
			ὑποκινήσει</span> on a chair which <i>will</i> not <i>shake,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.47
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>to be deranged in mind,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ . . μαινόμενος καὶ ὑποκεκινηκώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					573c
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
